      "answer": "C",
      "reason_rejected": "Paper towels are disposable and porous; they cannot be effectively decontaminated for safe reuse in a controlled investigation."
    },
    {
      "answer": "D",
      "reason_rejected": "Chemicals are consumed or contaminated during use and are not typically 'reused' in the same manner as equipment; they are disposed of as waste."
    }
  ]
